# Notes and documentation are deliberately untracked: this repository holds source and
# project files only. To start tracking one, use `git add -f <file>.md`.
*.md

# The README is the exception. It is what the repository shows a visitor, so it is tracked.
!README.md

# The commit history from before the 0.5.0-alpha squash, kept locally to read back.
GIT-HISTORY.txt

# Reverse-engineering tooling stays local. The probe opens the running game and reads its
# memory; it is not part of the product and is not in the solution.
tools/RuneFoundry.Probe/
